        }
      }
    },
    "We use your location only while the app is open, to show plans within walking distance. It stays on your phone unless you post a plan at your current spot." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the app uses location.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usamos tu ubicación solo mientras la app está abierta para mostrarte planes a los que puedes llegar caminando. Se queda en tu teléfono, a menos que publiques un plan en tu ubicación actual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll let the %lld people who joined know it's cancelled and close the group chat." : {
      "comment" : "Pluralization for the plural form of \"person\" in the context of a game cancellation.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
