          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll let the 1 person who joined know it's cancelled and close the group chat." : {
      "comment" : "A message that appears when cancelling a game.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avisaremos a la persona que se unió que el plan se canceló y cerraremos el chat del grupo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll remove your profile, cancel the plans you host and give up your spots right away. People in your plans will see a spot open up." : {
